  m_Name: Villager
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DevSidePage
  leftPageInfo: '<align=center><size=140%>- Villagers -</size></align>

    Civilians
    that live in your village

    - <b>Fed</b> with wheat

    - <b>Housed</b> in
    Motels <size=80%>(Building) </size>

    - <b>Employed</b> at Workplaces <size=80%>(e.g
    Mines, Farms)</size>

    <align=center>- - - -</align>

    Taking good care
    of them by feeding them well, housing them, and giving them jobs helps in improving
    your <color=#305D42><size=110%><i>Global Morality.</i></size></color>'
